:"conj.","definitionZh":"当…时","glossesEn":["when, while"],"examples":[{"english":"as she grew older, she grew richer","chinese":"她越老越富有"},{"english":"as a student, I had strong left-wing views","chinese":"我当学生的时候有强烈的左派观点"}]},{"id":"as:o:59292be292b3","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"因为","glossesEn":["because, since"],"examples":[{"english":"as it's Sunday, the smaller shops are shut","chinese":"由于是星期天，小店铺都关门了"},{"english":"as she is sick, she cannot go out","chinese":"她病了，所以不能外出"}]},{"id":"as:o:e3b9d1d8ed29","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"尽管","glossesEn":["though"],"examples":[{"english":"clever as he is, he is still inexperienced","chinese":"他虽然聪明，但还缺乏经验"},{"english":"be that as it may","chinese":"尽管如此"},{"english":"try as he might, he could not forget it","chinese":"他努力去忘记却还是忘不了这件事"}]},{"id":"as:o:a3dc5523520a","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"如同","glossesEn":["expressing similarity"],"examples":[{"english":"the same … as","chinese":"同…一样…"},{"english":"the same man as I saw last week","chinese":"我上周见到的那个人"},{"english":"the same as always","chinese":"一如既往"}]},{"id":"as:o:819f4c11b8e8","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"为了","glossesEn":["expressing purpose"],"examples":[{"english":"so as not to wake him","chinese":"以免把他吵醒"}]},{"id":"as:o:66608b28c98e","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"与…同样地…；他不如你聪明；她钢琴弹得和她姐妹一样好；能跑多快就跑多快；多达1万人；壮得像头牛；早在1849年；他们除了在巴黎有一套公寓，在尼斯还有一幢房子；他不只是诗人，也是小说家；只有…的一半贵；他们的利润减少了30%之多","glossesEn":["expressing degree, extent"],"examples":[{"english":"he is not as or so intelligent as you","chinese":"他不如你聪明"},{"english":"she can play the piano as well as her sister","chinese":"她钢琴弹得和她姐妹一样好"},{"english":"run as fast as you can","chinese":"能跑多快就跑多快"}]},{"id":"as:o:b889114ea0e7","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"像…一样","glossesEn":["expressing similarity"],"examples":[{"english":"they tried to carry on as before","chinese":"他们试图像往常一样继续下去"},{"english":"I thought as much!","chinese":"我原本也这么想！"},{"english":"V as in Victor","chinese":"如Victor中的V"}]},{"id":"as:o:a0ba9da151