o it this minute!","chinese":"你必须马上做！"}]},{"id":"will:o:91ebdc91a671","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示推测","glossesEn":["in conjecture"],"examples":[{"english":"that will be my sister","chinese":"那应该是我的姐姐"},{"english":"he'll be about 30 now","chinese":"他现在大概30岁了吧"}]},{"id":"will:o:c0f073c03b66","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"用于陈述一般事实","glossesEn":["stating general truth"],"examples":[{"english":"oil will float on water","chinese":"油浮于水"},{"english":"these things will happen","chinese":"这些事情终究要发生的"},{"english":"teachers will tell you that …","chinese":"老师都会告诉你…"}]},{"id":"will:o:01ebf0e42075","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示能力或容量","glossesEn":["expressing ability, capacity"],"examples":[{"english":"the lift will take 12","chinese":"这部电梯可载12人"},{"english":"the car will do 120 km/h","chinese":"这辆汽车每小时能跑120公里"},{"english":"the door won’t open!","chinese":"门打不开！"}]},{"id":"will:o:e3ee612d3729","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示习惯","glossesEn":["describing habit"],"examples":[{"english":"she’ll listen to music for hours","chinese":"她听音乐总是一听就是几个小时"},{"english":"he would spend hours on the phone","chinese":"他电话一打就是好几个小时"}]},{"id":"will:o:d31bc29c2060","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"重读will或would，表示对习惯性行为感到恼火","glossesEn":["in exasperation"],"examples":[{"english":"she will run the dishwasher at midnight","chinese":"她总爱在半夜开洗碗机"},{"english":"he would have to go there!","chinese":"他居然去了那里！"}]},{"id":"will:o:a13830bd533c","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"愿意","glossesEn":["like"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"ask who you will","chinese":"你想问谁就问谁"},{"english":"call it what you will, it’s still a problem","chinese":"不管你怎么说，这仍然是个问题"}]},{"id":"will:o:7b26957fb6f3","label":"n.","definitionZh":"意志","glossesEn":["mental power"],"examples":[{"english":"to have a strong/weak will","chinese":"意志坚强/薄弱"},{"english":"by an effort of will","chinese":"用意志力"},{"english":"to have a will of one's own","chinese":"固执己见"}]},{"id":"will:o:ef703a208bf7","label":"n.","definiti